commit 293b57868cbe3764e6277e173a29711040e4a911

C03: a verified navigation is reported as done, never promised (WEB1261 repair)

WEB1259: after browser.navigate completed and verified, six finals said
«Voy a youtube.» / «Vamos a github.»: the composer payload marked
outcome=completed only for app.open and nothing rejected a promise. The
navigation operations now carry the completed outcome, a status hint asks
for the past tense (naming a sign-in page when the final URL is one), and
promised_effect rejects a draft that promises to go.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


